<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>우리 카페 - 메뉴</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5e6d3 0%, #e8d5c4 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B4513 0%, #A0522D 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 18px;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .menu-wrapper {
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .menu-category {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .category-title {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #8B4513;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #D2B48C;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .menu-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .menu-item {
            background: #fafaf8;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #D2B48C;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .menu-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .item-name {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .item-description {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .item-price {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #8B4513;
        }

        .filter-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .filter-btn {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: 2px solid #D2B48C;
            background: white;
            color: #8B4513;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .filter-btn:hover,
        .filter-btn.active {
            background: #8B4513;
            color: white;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #f5e6d3;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            border-top: 1px solid #D2B48C;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .menu-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .category-title {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>☕ 우리 카페</h1>
            <p>신선한 커피와 정성 가득한 음식</p>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-wrapper">
            <div class="filter-buttons">
                <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="filterMenu('all')">전체</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMenu('coffee')">커피</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMenu('tea')">차</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMenu('food')">음식</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMenu('dessert')">디저트</button>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-category" data-category="coffee">
                <div class="category-title">☕ 커피</div>
                <div class="menu-grid">
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">아메리카노</div>
                        <div class="item-description">진한 에스프레소와 뜨거운 물의 조화</div>
                        <div class="item-price">4,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">카페라떼</div>
                        <div class="item-description">부드러운 우유의 매력, 따뜻한 라떼</div>
                        <div class="item-price">5,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">카푸치노</div>
                        <div class="item-description">에스프레소와 스팀 우유의 완벽한 배합</div>
                        <div class="item-price">5,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">카라멜 마키아또</div>
                        <div class="item-description">달콤한 카라멜 시럽과 우유의 조합</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">초콜릿 모카</div>
                        <div class="item-description">초콜릿의 풍미가 가득한 따뜻한 음료</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">바닐라 라떼</div>
                        <div class="item-description">상큼한 바닐라향의 부드러운 라떼</div>
                        <div class="item-price">5,500원</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-category" data-category="tea">
                <div class="category-title">🍵 차</div>
                <div class="menu-grid">
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">아이스 초콜릿</div>
                        <div class="item-description">시원한 초콜릿 음료</div>
                        <div class="item-price">5,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">딸기 요거트 스무디</div>
                        <div class="item-description">신선한 딸기와 요거트의 상큼함</div>
                        <div class="item-price">7,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">말차 라떼</div>
                        <div class="item-description">은은한 말차의 향과 맛</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">유자 차</div>
                        <div class="item-description">상큼한 유자의 매력</div>
                        <div class="item-price">5,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">홍차 라떼</div>
                        <div class="item-description">고급 홍차와 부드러운 우유</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">아이스 아메리카노</div>
                        <div class="item-description">시원한 아메리카노</div>
                        <div class="item-price">4,500원</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-category" data-category="food">
                <div class="category-title">🥐 음식</div>
                <div class="menu-grid">
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">크로아상</div>
                        <div class="item-description">바삭한 프랑스식 크로아상</div>
                        <div class="item-price">5,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">치즈 베이글</div>
                        <div class="item-description">크림치즈가 가득한 베이글</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">계란 샌드위치</div>
                        <div class="item-description">신선한 계란과 야채의 조화</div>
                        <div class="item-price">7,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">그릭 요거트 보울</div>
                        <div class="item-description">그래놀라와 베리가 들어간 요거트</div>
                        <div class="item-price">8,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">쌀 주먹밥</div>
                        <div class="item-description">알싸한 참치 주먹밥</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">허브 파니니</div>
                        <div class="item-description">신선한 허브와 치킨이 들어간 파니니</div>
                        <div class="item-price">8,500원</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-category" data-category="dessert">
                <div class="category-title">🍰 디저트</div>
                <div class="menu-grid">
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">초콜릿 케이크</div>
                        <div class="item-description">진한 초콜릿의 풍미</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">치즈 케이크</div>
                        <div class="item-description">진하고 부드러운 치즈 케이크</div>
                        <div class="item-price">7,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">딸기 쇼트케이크</div>
                        <div class="item-description">상큼한 딸기와 생크림</div>
                        <div class="item-price">7,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">초콜릿 브라우니</div>
                        <div class="item-description">촉촉한 초콜릿 브라우니</div>
                        <div class="item-price">5,500원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">초콜릿 무스</div>
                        <div class="item-description">가볍고 부드러운 초콜릿 무스</div>
                        <div class="item-price">6,000원</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-item">
                        <div class="item-name">마카롱</div>
                        <div class="item-description">다양한 맛의 프랑스식 마카롱</div>
                        <div class="item-price">4,500원</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>우리 카페</strong></p>
            <p>📍 서울시 강남구 강남대로 123 | 📞 02-1234-5678</p>
            <p>⏰ 월-금 07:00 ~ 22:00 | 토-일 08:00 ~ 21:00</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function filterMenu(category) {
            document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn').forEach(btn => {
                btn.classList.remove('active');
            });
            event.target.classList.add('active');

            document.querySelectorAll('.menu-category').forEach(cat => {
                if (category === 'all' || cat.dataset.category === category) {
                    cat.style.display = 'block';
                } else {
                    cat.style.display = 'none';
                }
            });
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
